sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as a client<br/>internal/api/http/endpoint/lists.go
    participant Handler as CompleteItemHandler<br/>internal/command/complete_item.go
    participant Service as service.ItemLists<br/>internal/service/item_lists.go
    participant Repository as postgres.Repository of ItemRow<br/>internal/infrastructure/postgres/repository.go
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>+Handler: CompleteItem(home, item 1, version 7) from POST .../items/1/complete
    Handler->>+Service: Item(ctx, home, 1)
    Service->>+Repository: SelectBy(ItemOfList).Single
    Repository->>+DB: SELECT ..., xmin FROM list_items
    DB-->>-Repository: the row, xmin 9: another caller changed it
    Repository-->>-Service: ItemRow, Version 9
    Service-->>-Handler: KeptItem, Version 9
    Note over Handler: item.Complete(), then item.Version = 7, the caller's, not 9
    Handler->>+Service: Save(ctx, home, item at version 7)
    Service->>+Repository: Update(ctx, &ItemRow{Version: 7})
    Repository->>+DB: UPDATE ... WHERE id = 1 AND xmin = '7'::xid RETURNING xmin
    DB-->>-Repository: no row
    Repository-->>-Service: ErrRowChanged
    Service-->>-Handler: errorkind.Wrap(ErrConcurrentChange, "read it again", err)
    Handler-->>-Client: 409 ABORTED: read it again
